    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Okay, I'll look into encryption. One more thing though—what happens if there's a breach? Like, if someone actually manages to get into my system and steals the list, what are my immediate responsibilities under GDPR? I'm worried about those 'hidden' vulnerabilities you mentioned or just random things going wrong behind the scenes that I didn't catch.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
