      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "If a breach occurs, your immediate duty is to assess the risk to the individuals whose data was affected. If the breach poses a high risk to their rights and freedoms, you must notify the relevant supervisory authority (like the CNIL in France) within 72 hours. Additionally, if the risk is high, you must also inform the affected customers without undue delay. Always try to document exactly what happened, how you discovered it, and what steps you took to mitigate the damage afterward.",
